      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I still remember the faces you guys made right after I scored
      that game winning goal.
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 1
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 30}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba9b6e42745907d4c86bb46deb7362be, type: 2}
